---
---

<section class="bg-surface py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="mb-6">
      <span class="w-6 h-0.5 bg-primary mb-4 block"></span>
      <span class="text-primary text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-widest">Reconstruction</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-[48px] leading-[48px] font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-foreground mb-12">
      How the Site Was Rebuilt
    </h2>

    <p class="text-[16px] leading-[26px] text-muted-foreground mb-12 max-w-3xl">
      When the original site was no longer accessible, we worked from every available source to reconstruct an accurate, modern representation of M&G Security's online presence.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="bg-background border border-gray-100 p-8 rounded-none hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6 text-xl">
          <i class="ri-file-search-line"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-foreground mb-4 uppercase tracking-wide">Source Material</h3>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          The original M&G Security website was no longer live at the time of this rebuild. Content, service descriptions, and factual information were reconstructed from publicly available web archive snapshots, the company's active Facebook presence, and direct brand assets provided by the client.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-background border border-gray-100 p-8 rounded-none hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6 text-xl">
          <i class="ri-edit-box-line"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-foreground mb-4 uppercase tracking-wide">Content Gaps</h3>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Where original text was fragmented or unavailable, descriptions were carefully composed to align with the company's known service offerings, verified location, and established brand voice. No fictional claims were introduced — all service descriptions reflect the actual security work M&G Security performs in Berks County.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-background border border-gray-100 p-8 rounded-none hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6 text-xl">
          <i class="ri-image-line"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-foreground mb-4 uppercase tracking-wide">Visual Assets</h3>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          The original logo was of low resolution, so all lockup and icon variants were recreated from scratch in both vector and raster formats. Gallery photography was generated to represent the types of events and sites M&G Security protects, since original photo archives were not recoverable. All generated imagery depicts realistic security scenarios consistent with the company's work.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-background border border-gray-100 p-8 rounded-none hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6 text-xl">
          <i class="ri-shield-check-line"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-foreground mb-4 uppercase tracking-wide">Verification</h3>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Every phone number, address, and service category shown on this site was cross-referenced against archived pages and public records. We recommend the client review all content for accuracy before final publication, and we welcome corrections or additions at any time.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
